    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards and Knights is turn-based fantasy strategy game featuring randomly generated maps for an infinite replayability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to battle five other AI controlled teams to conquer the world. Move your knights and wizards across the hex game board conquering towns and defeating the enemy. Combines the quick learning curve of a board game with the deep strategy and rich game play of a simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include a map editor, saving games, four difficulty levels with advanced AI play against the computer.</p>",
